# Agri Soft Pro mobile

This repo is the **mobile companion** for Agri Soft Pro. Read and follow `MOBILE_BRIEF.md` before coding.

## What this is
Phone/tablet app for shop staff. It shares **Supabase Postgres** with the existing desktop ERP (Electron + Next.js + SQLite). Do not rewrite the desktop ERP.

## Architecture
Desktop (SQLite) ↔ Supabase Postgres ↔ Mobile app. Cloud sync only. No LAN / Wi‑Fi peer sync.

## Current work
Milestones 1–3: Expo Router + TypeScript, env, Supabase client (anon + RLS), Home, Customers, Products (read-only), Settings.

## Hard rules
- Never put `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` in this app. Anon key + RLS only.
- Scope every shop query by `tenant_id`. Match the desktop shop id (`settings.supabase_tenant_id`, else `.env` `SUPABASE_TENANT_ID`). Dev fallback: `tenant-dev-001`.
- Ignore soft-deleted rows (`deleted_at` is not null).
- Keep the same row ids as desktop (text/uuid).
- Do not invent secrets. Ask for the anon key or use `.env`. Never commit `.env`.
- If RLS hides rows from anon, add create-only SELECT policies (`docs/dev-rls.sql`). Do not drop tables. Do not use service_role.
- Do not build Super Admin, licenses, LAN sync, WhatsApp, or a full POS before customers work.

## Stack
Expo + Expo Router + TypeScript + `@supabase/supabase-js`. Not Flutter, Ionic, web-as-app, or Electron.

## UX
Clear labels (Sale, Customer, Product). Names in lists, not codes. Calm agri-green UI. Large tap targets.
